      "Encouraging Words ",
      " ",
      "True encouraging words focus on the action, not the person. These will motivate ",
      "your child from the inside to show similar positive behavior in the future, and to ",
      "value things like hard work, improvement, teamwork, and persistence. Source: ",
      "Positive Parenting Solutions, www.positiveparentingsolutions.com/parenting/encouraging-words ",
